.wikidot.com/scp-3396">SCP-3396</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3895">SCP-3895</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4568">SCP-4568</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5034">SCP-5034</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5866">SCP-5866</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Ticonderoga（提康德罗加<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-400299-22" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >22</a></sup>）</td> <td>项目无法被收容，也无必要如此。</td> <td><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/r-00x-s-proposal">R-00X的提案（日分）</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4270">SCP-4270</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4444">SCP-4444</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5170">SCP-5170</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5494">SCP-5494</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Truculent</td> <td>项目无法预测且收容必须适应不断变化的环境。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4703">SCP-4703</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>无法收容</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-es-100-ex">SCP-ES-100-EX</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5471">SCP-5471</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Uncontained（未收容）</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/propuesta-de-nico">Nico的提案</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-340-fr">SCP-340-FR</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3005">SCP-3005</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3681">SCP-3681</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5074">SCP-5074</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5097">SCP-5097</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5346">SCP-5346</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5471">SCP-5471</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5859">SCP-5859</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Unknown（未知）</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3005">SCP-3005</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4604">SCP-4604</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4972">SCP-4972</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Unnecessary（不必要）</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lily-s-proposal">Lily的提案</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4023">SCP-4023</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5143">SCP-5143</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Yesod（基础<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-400299-23" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >23</a></sup>）</td> <td>项目已整合于基金会的指挥机构。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/spikebrennan-s-proposal">spikebrennan的提案</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4436">SCP-4436</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Zeno（芝诺<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-400299-24" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >24</a></sup>）</td> <td>项目具有中等收容难度以及低威胁性。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2005">SCP-2005</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Zurvan</td> <td>项目构成了基准现实的某个方面且不应受到干扰。</td> <td><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5103">SCP-5103</a></td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h2><span>子类分级</span></h2> <p>由于某些异常并不完全符合标准收容分级——同时保证不自己创建一个新的分级——一些子类分级已被创建以用于进一步描述它们的属性和/或它们的收容。</p> <div class="eso-list"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;子类分级&nbsp;◄</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;子类分级&nbsp;▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <h3><span>后缀系统</span></h3> <p>以下的子类分级被附加到标准分级中（<em>举例：</em>Safe-alterius）以表示异常的属性。这些类中有几个缺乏既定的定义；在这种情况下，定义已被我们推断出来。</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>分级名称</th> <th>分级定义</th> <th>典例</th> </tr> <tr> <td>alterius</td> <td>项目为地外实体。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-824">SCP-824</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1041">SCP-1041</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1141">SCP-1141</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>adviso</td> <td>项目的分级已被暂时公布但可能会发生变化。</td> <td><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5158">SCP-5158</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>doctrina</td> <td>项目正在进行调查或测试。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1306">SCP-1306</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5080">SCP-5080</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5211">SCP-5211</a>，<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5235">SCP-5235</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>exsequi</td> <td>项目可独立行动。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-928">SCP-928</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1268">SCP-1268</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1606">SCP-1606</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1646">SCP-1646</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1846">SCP-1846</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1868">SCP-1868</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2020">SCP-2020</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4766">SCP-4766</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>flecto</td> <td>项目表现出一种或多种生物异变性状。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-625">SCP-625</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>impetus</td> <td>项目是敌对的。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-066">SCP-066</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-619">SCP-619</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-984">SCP-984</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1626">SCP-1626</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>nuntii</td> <td>项目具有模因性质。</td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-868">SCP-868</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1246">SCP-1246</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1248">SCP-1248</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1448">SCP-1448</a>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4766">SCP-4766</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>numen</td> <td>项目与神明相关。</td> <td><a href="http://